---
version: 2.0.2
title: testing: an invalid gleam.toml fails the run
file: ./test/grice/testing_test.gleam
test_name: an_invalid_gleam_toml_fails_the_run_test
---
error[grice/invalid-config]: Unknown key in `gleam.toml`

`gleam.toml` sets `tools.grice.included`, which grice doesn't read. The
keys of `[tools.grice]` are `include`, `exclude`, `ignore` and
`suppression_comments`.

Hint: Remove the key, or fix its spelling.

grice couldn't complete the run. Fix the problems above and run it again.

